Z||000000||Fearless Freep||09-06-2000||04:56 PM||||Had a sebring convertible trying to play tag with my bumper.<P>As the story goes....cruisin along I-40 (In Raleigh)doing about 70...this sebring comes whipping around the side and tries to pass..(nobody else around but us). Well I goose the gas a little and take it up to 90, keeping the sebring a half car lenght behind.  That pissed em off cause I heard them trying to get into overdrive....I goose the gas a little more and now moving along at 110.  They are now more than 1 car lenght behind........course then I caught up with slower traffic (the people doing 65).  I slowed down to merge in...they whipped around to the far outside and kept going.  I suppose to make themselves look good???  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||1
